    ('arlechinmelbourne', 'Puttanesca Martinez', 'A Martinez reworked after the classic pasta sauce, using an in-house tomato oil.', 'Inspired by a mural outside the bar; the tomato oil comes from semi-dehydrated tomatoes blended with heat. Only the tomato oil is named in the sources. Source: https://australianbartender.com.au/2024/07/08/arlechin', 'Martinez', 2024, 'russell.branford', NULL, NULL),
