    ('barlonghi_venice', 'Wild Fennel Martini', 'The bar''s signature martini variation, made with an artisanal wild fennel liqueur and prepared at the table.', 'Created by bar manager Cristiano Luciani; announced by the hotel on Facebook roughly seven years before this search, and listed on the hotel''s pages as the signature serve.', 'Martini', NULL, 'cristiano.luciani', NULL, NULL),
