    ('ilmercantevenice', 'Fermenting Provence', 'A kombucha-based drink with calvados and Pineau des Charentes, also offered alcohol-free.', 'On the ''Bar Techniques'' menu under Fermentation (9% ABV). An alcohol-free version is listed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
