    ('combat.belleville', 'Impécâpre', 'A tequila sour-style drink built on capers, Suze and walnut with white vermouth and lemon.', 'Described in a September 2024 Les Nouvelles Gastronomiques interview with Margot Lecarpentier, and in her Instagram reel as a Sunday drink; still on the 2026 menu.', NULL, NULL, 'margot.lecarpentier', NULL, NULL),
